OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThe strong
OL,6,Fwinds and showers will ease to bring a
OL,7,Fsettled night with plenty of clear
OL,8,Fspells, although the odd light showers
OL,9,Fmay linger, mainly around Lancashire.
OL,10,FWinds becoming light and feeling
OL,11,Fchilly.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSunday:FA chilly start tomorrow, but
OL,14,Fwith sunny spells and a light breeze
OL,15,Fit will begin to feel warmer than on
OL,16,FSaturday. Dry during the day, but rain
OL,17,Fwill arrive overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
