OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FMonday
OL,6,Fwill be widely overcast with spots of
OL,7,Frain through the day. Becoming much
OL,8,Fbrighter on Tuesday after a morning of
OL,9,Frain and strong winds. Bright and
OL,10,Fbreezy on Wednesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
